            <run fontname="Arial" fontsize="10" bold="false" fontcolor="#3D4A5C">AT 10% CAPACITY · LR B finds 688 delays in 1,000 reviews (68.8% precision; 21.4% capture; 2.14× lift). Historical risk finds 442; random expectation is 321.5.
The list airport control only narrows displayed rows; global ranks, quotas and scorecards stay fixed. Exact seed-42 hash tie order comes from Python. Random counts are expectations.
No measured costs, interventions, savings or prevented delays. A high score is not a calibrated probability.</run>
